{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》開播初期，已表明會加入「隱藏女神」元素，為今季「不設分組，自由配對」的大前提，增添新鮮刺激感。</p><p>周日（18日）晚播出第7集《女神2》，2位「隱藏女神」將登場。</p><p>無綫官網公布「隱藏女神」為梁超怡及陳星妤，並順帶公開2人的MBTI、拍拖次數及個人資料。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:20:55.176423+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:52:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:57:35.236392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:17:39.807628+00:00","content_hash":"904443d3a6683f82f8a84df634d1f93ab7b55ba3768ffa5746713055092fb5ee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}